<div class="q-item"><p>2. The fitness coach asks your age and preferred role on the pitch. Reply in two short Spanish sentences:</p><input type="text" class="open-input" placeholder="Type your Spanish response..."><div class="model-box"><strong>Sample Pitch Answer:</strong> Tengo [edad] años. Juego de mediocentro / delantero.</div></div>
<div class="q-item"><p>3. Ask a new teammate where he is from and what position he plays:</p><input type="text" class="open-input" placeholder="Type your Spanish response..."><div class="model-box"><strong>Sample Pitch Answer:</strong> ¿De dónde eres y de qué posición juegas?</div></div>
